Recovered / adapted code
------------------------------------------------------------------------
Portions of the pure-Dart .vsdx engine (model / parser / formula) and the
renderer under lib/render/ were recovered and adapted from the sibling
project `visiovsdxviewer` (MIT License), at commit 0fcaf66^ (the pre-pivot
pure-Dart stack). See docs/REUSE_MAP.md.

